851
00:39:51.120 --> 00:39:52.550
- Yeah.

852
00:39:52.620 --> 00:39:55.220
The humidity. it's awful.

853
00:39:55.320 --> 00:39:56.860
All I do is write
parking tickets.

854
00:39:56.990 --> 00:40:01.220
